{"description":"STAY: An Immersive Listening Night with Alex Lustig playing Ambient Hours Set\nAn evening designed around slowing down, listening, and simply staying.\nJoin us at Ratelier for an immersive ambient listening experience featuring Alex Lustig, where live music, scent, light, and space come together to create a place for rest and presence.\nSettle in, get comfortable, and experience two hours of live ambient sound within a softly transformed Ratelier.\nScent. Live ambient music. Space to rest.\nYour ticket includes:\n2-hour entry to the experience\nLive ambient performance by Alex Lustig\nImmersive scent and spatial atmosphere by Ratelier\nPremium welcome tea by Ratelier\nFree copy of Ambient Hours 001, in collaboration with Offbrand Library\nSession 1 Entry: 6PM / Session 2 Entry: 8PM\nCome as you are. Find a place to settle in. Stay awhile.\n*Limited Seats available.","organizer":"Ratelier Studio"}